the associate cloud engineer track  enables you to become proficient with  Google cloud platform through hands-on  practice with quick labs the track  provides quick labs credits that you can  use to complete the labs free of charge  here are the steps to redeem quick labs  credits at the beginning of the program  an invitation email was sent to you from  Google cloud edu and Coursera and the  subject line you are invited to learn on  Coursera the email provides the link to  redeem quick labs credits and the access  code the link in the invitation email  will directly open quick labs the Google  cloud training platform and prompt you  for the access code here are the steps  using an example click the invitation  link copy and paste the access code as  prompted and click Submit sign into your  quick labs account click on join with  email to set up your Quick Labs account  setup your quick labs account enter your  first name last name and your email  address specify the same email address  that you use for your Coursera account  for company name specify your  institutions name or none enter password  enable the opt-in box to receive  information about new content and  special discounts after you complete the  cloud architecture quest enable CAPTCHA  and click create a new account once you  have created your Quick Labs account you  may verify that credits have been added  to your quick labs account click on the  user profile to review your quick labs  credit status click on the user profile  within your user profile click my  account and click on credits and  subscriptions for additional quick labs  account information redeeming quick labs  credits for the associate cloud engineer  track is a one-time process if you  already have a quick labs account and  enrolled in the cloud architecture quest  before  please unenroll in the quest and then  click the enroll button again only when  you click the enroll button will the  credits be applied to your account if  there are any other problems email  support at quick labs comm the team will  respond quickly we  now reviewed the steps to redeem quick  lab credits create your account verify  that quick labs credits have been added  to your account and that support at  quick labs comm is your resource for  troubleshooting assistance
 

